    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance to agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, reducing processing time, and proposing relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, and past AI use cases, what AI components can our design to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide intelligent assistance to agents and meet the specified requirements, our can leverage several AI components from our LLM stack." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our LLM expertise with models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT can be utilized for generating high-quality answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fine-tuning models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT using methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tune on a domain corpus can further enhance models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT performance, potentially achieving an average accuracy gain of 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our RAG capabilities can be employed to facilitate access to information and improve answer quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse retrieval, or hybrid approaches, we can efficiently retrieve relevant information from knowledge bases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The use of chunking strategies such as recursive text splitting, semantic chunking, or document-aware splitting can also aid in providing more accurate answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our explainability tools, including source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, can be used to provide transparent and trustworthy outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Confidence scoring can also help identify low-confidence answers, which can then be escalated to human supervisors for review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, considering our past AI use cases in domains like public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city, we can design domain-specific AI components that cater to the unique requirements of each area." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, we could develop a regulatory document Q&A assistant or a clinical guideline assistant, both of which can benefit from our RAG capabilities and fine-tuning expertise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating domain-specific AI components that cater to the unique requirements of each area, we can create an intelligent assistance system that not only provides high-quality answers but also facilitates access to information, reduces processing time, and proposes relevant information to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to reduce The City of Belval environmental footprint, and the solution must contribute to aims by relying on infrastructure with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs, how can our ensure the solution meets these sustainability requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the solution meets these sustainability requirements, our can leverage our existing green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy. our digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, will also contribute to reducing the carbon footprint of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a current total Scope 1 and 2 emissions of 148 tCO2e and a net-zero target year of 2040, our can provide transparency on our carbon reporting capability, which follows the GRI Standards, albeit partially. our typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%, which demonstrates our commitment to reducing energy consumption. our EcoVadis Silver rating with a score of 62 indicates that our have a good foundation in CSR and sustainability practices, which can be built upon to meet these sustainability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our AI ethics principles, including human oversight, non-discrimination, transparency, and the right to contest AI-generated suggestions, will ensure that the solution is not only environmentally sustainable but also socially responsible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding known sustainability trade-offs, our have standard resolutions in place to address tensions between high availability and energy consumption, on-premise vs green energy, and performance vs model size." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, our can implement low-power standby modes with wake-up times under 90 seconds to meet high availability requirements while reducing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these elements, our can propose a solution that effectively contributes to The City of Belval goal of reducing The City of Belval environmental footprint while ensuring social responsibility and AI ethics are upheld." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to implement an artificial intelligence solution to assist The City of Belval agents in its agents daily tasks, improving the efficiency and quality of administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

