    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements for the City of Belval to implement an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents, improve efficiency and quality of services, and considering the constraints on data protection (GDPR), sovereignty, and technical requirements (e.g., integration with existing systems, high availability, response time under 2 seconds), how do we consolidate we past experiences in public sector projects, available capacity, and governance practices to ensure a coherent tender response?" ;
